SUMMARY:Switzerland: First 13th AHV old-age pension paid in December 2026
DESCRIPTION:Starts in December 2026\; the source does not state the day. De
 cember 2026. The 13th AHV pension is paid for the first time in December 2
 026 to around 2.6 million pensioners\, equal to one-twelfth of the old-age
  pensions paid during the year.\n\nSource: https://www.bsv.admin.ch/de/ums
 etzung-13-ahv-rente\nDetails: https://www.intelligentpayroll.eu/countries/
 switzerland.html#ch-13th-ahv\n\nFor information only\, not legal or tax ad
 vice. Sources last checked 1 October 2026.
